.TH sam-jail-desktop 1 2026-11-10 "SAM 0.1.0" "SAM Manual"
.SH NAME
sam\-jail\-desktop \- Install or remove the desktop launcher. `sam\-jail desktop all refresh` rewrites every launcher whose command is outdated (e.g. SAM\*(Aqs AppImage was moved)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsam\-jail desktop\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIAPP\fR> <\fIACTION\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Install or remove the desktop launcher. `sam\-jail desktop all refresh` rewrites every launcher whose command is outdated (e.g. SAM\*(Aqs AppImage was moved)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIAPP\fR>

.TP
<\fIACTION\fR>

